CHAPTER II.lncorporation:(a) There shall be an established lnstitute (llMS) to be called ISLAMABADINSTITUTE OF MODERN SCIENCES (llMS), ISLAMABAD, Consistingof the Chancellor, Rector, Pro- Chancellor, Rector, Deans, Chairman,Registrar, Controller Examination, Director Finance/treasurer of suchother officers as may be prescribed.(b) The main campus of the lnstitute (llMS) will be at lslamabad Pakistanand the lnstitute (llMS) shall take necessary measures to set upcampus/campuses within the limitation and jurisdiction of State ofPakistan.(c) The lnstitute (llMS) shall be owned, managed and administered by the'PARADIGM MEDIA (PVT) LIMITED" Gompany and shall haveperpetual succession and a common seal and may sue and be sued bythe said name.
(d)
The lnstitute (llMS) shall be competent to acquire and hold property,both movable and immovable, to lease, sell or otherwise transfer anyproperty which may have become vested in or been acquired by it.The lnstitute (llMS) shall be open to all persons or either sex, anyreligions, race, creed, colour, or domicile who are academicallyqualified.ihe moral and ethical codes employed on the lnstitute (llMS) Campus,and the constituenU affilant, enlisted institutions will be based on andderived from the cardinal principles and the guidance embodied in theHoly Quran and the Sunnah of the Prophet (P.B.U.H)CHAPTER III
(e)
3. Powers and functions of the lnstitute (llMS):
The lnstitute (llMS) shall have the powers of
(f)
(e)
(0
(a)
(b)(c)(d)
Provide for instruction such as branches of learning as it may deem fitand to make provision for advancement & dissemination of knowledgeas it may determine; provided that the faculties may be set up as perrequirements of the Pakistan Councils, associations, and program ofacademic council/boards of respective programs;Prescribe courses of studies and curricula;Admit and hold examination at all levelsdegree/diplomas/certificates and other academic distinction to and onthe persons who have been admitted to and have passed itsexamination under prescribed condition;Confer honorary degrees/distinctions on approved persons asprescribed;Affiliate, enlist, associate, adapt, constitute and declaredisaffiliate/duelisUdisassociate reconstitute undeclared educationalinstitution under prescribed condition;Establish faculties, teaching departments, research institute, industriallearning center, Business lncubation Centers, Ianguage centers and
