(e) The Deans(0 The Directors(S) The Chairman of the teaching departments,(h) The Chairman/CEO/Director board and councilAssociations, organization,(i) The Registrar0) The Director of Finance/ Treasurer(k) The Controller of examinations(i) The librarian(l) Such persons as may be prescribed by the regulations
7. Patron of the lnstitute (llMS):
(a)(b)
The President of Pakistan shall be the patron of the lnstitute (llMS);When present, The Patron shall preside the convocation of the lnstitute([MS).Proposal of an honorary degree shall be subject to confirmation by thePatron.
8. The Chancellor:
(a) The PARADIGM MEDIA (PVT) LIMITED shall nominate, who shall preferablybe a person of eminence in letters, science or social work to be the chancellorof the lnstitute (llMS) for a period of three years, which may be extended bythe Company.(b) The Chancellor shall in the absence of the Patron preside at the convocationof the lnstitute (llMS).(c) The Chancellor may cause a visitation / inquiry in respect of mattersconnected with affairs of the lnstitute (llMS) and appoint persons as maydeem fit for the purpose. The Chancellor shall on receipt of d report undersub-section above, issue directions as he thinks fit and the Rector will complywith such directions subject to approval of BoD.
8.'1 Pro- Chancellor;
The Company shall nominate one of its Directors, who shall preferably be a personof eminence in letters, science or social work to be the Pro-chancellor of the lnstitute(llMS) for a period of three years, which may be extended by the company BoD.(a) The Pro-Chancellor shall in the absence of the chancellor preside atthe convocation of the lnstitute (llMS).(b) lf the pro-chanc,ellor is satisfied that the proceeding of an Authority ororder of an office is not in accordance with the provisions of this Act,the statutes, the regulations, or the rules, he may, after calling uponsuch Authority to show- cause why such proceedings should not beannulled, by order in writing and annul the proceedings or order.(c) Should the Pro- Chancellor be incapacitated from acting as such due toabsence or any other cause, the Chancellor shall exercise all the powerand perform all the duties and functions of the Chancellor.(d) The Pro-Chancellor may cause a visitation / inquiry in respect ofmatters connected with affairs of the lnstitute (llMS) and appoints
