9. . The Rector:
(a)
(b)
The Rector shall be appointed by the Company for a period of th'eeyears, which the Company BoD may further extend, on such terms etndconditions as the Company may determine.At any time when the office of the Rector is vacant;Or is unable to perform the functions of his office for any reasonswhatsoever, the Company shall make such arrangements for theperformance of the duties of the Rector as he may deem fit.
