a
a
(1) The Pro- Rector shall be appointed by the Company on such terrnsand conditions as may be determined on the recommendations of theBoD.(2) The Pro- Rector shall perform such functions as are assigned tohim by the BoD.
The RegistrarThe registrar shall be a whole-time officer of the lnstitute (llMS) appointed bythe BoD on such terms and conditions as the Board may determine
(b) The registrar shall be the custodian of the common seal and theacademic records of the lnstitute (llMS); and(c) Perform such other duties as may be prescribed.Director of Finance/ Treasurer:
