The Director of Finance shall be a whole time officer of the lnstitute(llMS) appointed by the Board on.such terms and conditions as theBoard may determine.The Director shall:{i) lt/anage the property/finances and the investments of thelnstitute (llMS);(ii) Prepare the annual/revised budget estimates and presentthem to the Finance Committee and the Board;(iii) Ensure that the funds are expended for the purpose forwhich they are provided; and(iv) Perform such other duties as may be prescribed
13. Controller of the examination:
14. The resident Auditor:
The auditor shall be a whole time offlcer of the lnstitute (llMS) and shallbe responsible for pre-audit of all payments from the lnstitute (llMS)fund.
15, The Director of planning and development:
Chapter VAUTHORITIES OF THE INSTITUTE (IIMS)16. Following shall be the authorities of the lnstitute (llMS):
(a)
(b)
The controller of examination shall be a whole time officer of thelnstitute (ltMS) and shall be responsible for all matters connected withthe conduct of examination and perform such other duties may beprescribed.
The Director of planning and Development shall be a whole time officerof the lnstitute (llMS). He shall be responsible for planning anddevelopment of the lnstitute (llMS) and shall also be responsible forpreparation of short and long term development plans for theresources. The facilities and the amenities shall perform such functionsas may be prescribed.
a)b)c)d)e)Ds)
The Board of Governors;The Academic Council;The Board of Faculties;The Board of Studies;The Selection Board;The Board of examinationThe Board 9f Enhepreneurial & Business lncubation Centers
