(vii)(viii)(ix)(x)(xi)
Each faculty shall include such institutes, teaching department's centersor the other teaching or research units as may be prescribed by thestatutes.
1. The Board ofa Faculty:
Faculty of postal and group learningFaculty of Engineering and TgchnologiesFaculty of Business & Management SciencesThe faculty of Humanities and Natural SciencesSuch other faculties as may be prescribed by the statutes.
The member mentioned in sub clause a (iii) above shall hold office fora period of three years.The quorum for a meeting of the Board of Faculty shall be one half ofthe total number of member, a fraction being counted as one.The Board of each faculty shall subject to the general control of theAcademic Council and the Board have powers to:-(i) Co-ordinate the teaching and research work in the subjectassigned to the faculty.(ii) Scrutinize the schemes of courses and syllabi proposed by theBoard of Studies compromised in the faculty and forward themto the Academic council along with its observation.(iii) Scutinize the recommendatlons made by the Board of studiescompromised in the faculty on appointment of paper setters andexaminers, except for research and degree examiners who shallbe scrutinized by Rector.(iv) Consider any other academic matter relating to the faculty andto report there on the Academic Council and;(v) Perform such other functions as may be prescribed by thestatutes.
(a) There shall be a board of each faculty consisting of:(i) Dean of the Faculty (Chairperson);(ii) Professors and Heads of Departments;(iii) Two Teachers, to be nominated by the Academic Council owingto their Specialized Knowledge of the Subjects which, though notassigned to the Faculty, have in the opinion of the AcademicCouncil, important bearing on the Subjects assigned to theFaculty;(iv) Two Experts, in the field from outside the lnstitute to beappointed bythe Board;(v) One member to be nominated by the Vice Chancellor; and(vi) Director Quality Enhancement Cell (QEC).
(b)(c)(d)
2. Deans:
There shall be a dean of each faculty who shall be the Chairman and theconveyor of the Board of faculty. The dean of a faculty:
