The quorum for a meeting of or an inspection by the Rector for,this purpose Registrar shall act as the Secretary of thecommittee or an officer of the Institute (lltvls) to be designated bythe Rector for this purpose shall act as the secretary of thecommittee.
13. Discipline Committee and its functions:
(a) The Discipline committee shali consist of:
v t.
(i) The Rector or his nominee;(ii) Two professors to be nominated by the Academic Council;(iii) One member to be nominated by the TrusUSociety and;(iv) The teacher or offices in charge of student affairs by whatevername called who shall act as member secretary.
(b) The term of office of the members of the Discipline committee, otherthan ex-officio members, shall be two years.(c) The quorum for a meeting of the Discipline Committee shall be threemembers.
14. Function of the Discipline Committee shall be:
(d) To propose regulations to the Academic council on the conduct of' . Insiitute (llMSf students, maintenance of discipline and for dealing withcases of in discipline:(e) To perform such other functions as may be assigned to it by statutes orregulations.

