The establishment of lslamabad lnstitute of Modern sciences (llMS) is a vital steptowards fostering educational excellence, research advancement, and intellectualdevelopment in the nation. This statement of objects and Reasons aims to outlinethe key objectives and rationale behind the creation of lslamabad lnstitute of ModernSciences (llMsy, r."ognizing the urgent need for a comprehensive institution ofhigher leaming ihrt udOrussEs the evolving needs and challenges of the Pakistanisociety.1. Fulfillment of Educational Demand: The creation of lslamabad lnstitute ofMod"rnsciences(llMS)aimstobridgethisgapandprovideaccessibleandinclusive educational opportunities for students from diverse backgrounds andregions across the country.2. Academic Excellence: By establishing lslamabad lnstitute of Modern sciences(llMS), we seeks to cre"te " world-class educational institution that upholdsiigo.r" academic standards and promotes excellence in research, teaching,and innovation.3. Fostering Research and lnnovation: lslamabad lnstitute of Modern sciences(llMS) will focus on facilitating cutting-edge research initiatives and forgingstrongpartnershipswithindustriesandresearchinstitutionsbothwithinPakistan and internationallY.4. Promoting lnterdisciplinary studies: lslamabad lnstitute of Modern sciences(llMS) wiil emphasize intlrdisciplinary studies. By breaking down..silos andencouragingcollaborationbetweendifferentacademicdisciplines,theuniversitJr will enable students and faculty to tackle complex issues withcomprehensive and holistic approaches'5. cultural and socioeconomic Development: lslamabad lnstitute of ModernSciences(llMS)willactivelycontributetoPakistan,sgrowthbyproducingskilledgraduateswhoareequippedtomakemeaningfulcontributionstosociety. Through its academic programs and community engagementinitiatives, the university will strive to uplift local communities and foster asense of social responsibility among its students'6' lnternationa| Collaboration and Exchange: lslamabad lnstitute of ModernSciences (llMS) will actively pursue international collaborations andencouragestudentandfacultyexchangeprogramswithrenowned.universities"".". tt" globe. Such partnerships will facilitate knowledge-sharing, culturalunderstanding,andexposuretodiverseperspectives'enrichingtheeducational experience of the university's constituents'
sd/-Dr. Zulfiqar Ali Bhatti,Member National AssemblY
